# arms/adult/action/onehand/dagger_r: the right (weapon) arm of the dagger family's three blows (P2c ACTIONS-1H, wave 2;
# STYLE_P2 12, 25.8; P2C_CONTRACTS 4). Painted by ACTIONS-1H's armpaint (A3's construction: a 3 px sleeve lit top-left,
# the 2 px leather bracer, the 4 x 3 fist; the far arm facing left a value darker, repainted, never the mirror), on the
# shoulder anchor so one drawing serves both bodies. Keys dg_<variant><w|s|f>: w the loaded pose, s the
# impact, f the follow-through (the recover is the guard). `grip` marks the fist's centre (the library weapon's origin).
use person
body adult
role arms std
layer held
anchor shoulderR
keys armR
side R
z 1

